Bravelanders, it's time for the fall update:

- There's a new story island in the game; it's accessible once you've defeated Tarik. Fight the enemy army and conquer Vulcan Island;
- A new special creature, the Butcher, has been added;
- Master's sword is now in the game;
- Other changes and improvements.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33645188/bcc76ca293e107ade259f01b561f5ada66e09d84.jpg[/img]

[previewyoutube=DSoTX-YGvbk;leftthumb][/previewyoutube]

- Meet two new Special Shooters. A Spearman Gnome and legendary elven Guardian of the Forest;
- Online Hunt mode added. Fight against armies of heroes and get a chance to get a Special Creature in your army. Hunt unlocks at level 50 and requires an equipped army of the hero;
- Improved promotions. We have also remodeled the fury system in story battles and improved prizes for completing the storyline. Auto Battle has also been fine-tuned and streamlined;
- Stars in the clan chest are awarded for both the Arena and the Hunt;
- Other changes and improvements.

[previewyoutube=TCiltLcIfvg;full][/previewyoutube]

Events:
- The festival of demons is about to begin in Braveland! New exclusive squads: Horned and Demonologist, are eager to join your army. Try your luck in special events. Don't miss your chance to participate in the festival!

Other changes:
- In-game UI and animation improvements;
- New Arena rules. Test your skills;
- Czech localization is added;
- Other changes and improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33645188/a0a14cd0e86b10cf0e153bdb4d476664c71383ac.png[/img]

  - A New Chapter of adventures is now open. Defeat the final boss Tariq and get the Royal Scepter back;
- Maximum level was increased to 50;
 - The Heavenly Forge was added to create new top equipment;
- Sharpening stones that allow you to upgrade your equipment were added;
- The imp is now available for dropping out of chests;
 - A new exclusive ent squad appeared in Braveland, keep up-to-date with our promotions and events;
- The Arena was modified. New stages were added, Arena prizes were improved;
- Improved algorithms for selecting an opponent in Online Duels and leveling the leadership of squads in the duel;
 - New spell levels were added;
- A new Magic Destruction Spell appeared for the heroes of the Northerners and the Kingdom;
 - Other changes and improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33645188/21209a0d96f53891c8b92fcbd8d625348d37ac1c.jpg[/img]

Bravelanders, here came the most enjoyable winter holiday!
we wish you and your loved ones this New Year, good health, financial well-being, positive mood and interesting travels. Let only pleasant and interesting people, beautiful places and a friendly atmosphere surround you.
Be happy, friends!

As always, we are summing up the passing year activities:

- A new chapter of adventures was unlocked. Maximum hero level was increased to 45. New equipment was added;

- Boss rage counter in raids was added and adjusted. The reward for raids has been radically redesigned - it has become not only more interesting, but also more profitable to raid a strong boss;

- A new hero, the Demon Lord, new creatures and spells were added to the game;

- The clan chest has been updated, the rewards have become more appealing, the three best players in the clan get improved chests. A new medal drop mode has been added in Online Duels. Medals depend on the percentage of army killed;

- Translations into 11 languages have been maintained;

- We switched to a new version of Unity - wich allowed us to fix some nasty bugs;

- A Royal chest can now be created with Arena Spheres in the smithy;

- A new reconnect system has been added for more stable online play;

- A feedback pop-up screen has been added which allows to write reviews and give ratings;

- Several equipment graphics have been reworked;

- Work was done to improve auto-battle. Limited auto-battles are now available to all players, unlimited auto-battles are available to players with the King’s Blessings. Auto-battle can be used immediately after purchase in battle;

- The game support for widescreen and 64-bit devices was improved;

- The Event building appeared in the City. Complete interesting tasks and get a worthy reward;

- The strength of your army is now indicated when forming it;

- Some creatures were rebalanced;

- Cooldowns system for the cooperative story battles was revised. You can now go through the story without cooldowns while winning;

- Tools for mass creation and disassembly of equipment and resources were added for owners of the King's Blessing;

- The story mode was improved. The story battles were made easier up to the 3rd chapter. Tips added during the playthrough of the first chapters;

- Story-mode rage was added. Frequent victories increase the rage and the number of opponents with it. Rage and quantity decreases over time;

And much more.

Happy New Year and good luck in conquering Braveland!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33645188/8742761c23dc90a1e621edf65b7d464ef1ce1ff3.png[/img]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33645188/99444708147bb0a234ef16b5f549e5e36824aeb1.jpg[/img]

Bravelanders, our summer update has been published!
[list]
[*] New reconnect system;
[*] We've added a Warrior chest. Once you have purchased the starter crystals set, you can collect crystals in the monthly chest by winning Online Duels;
[*] New creatures will appear in the game. Keep an eye out for special offers;
[*] Updated autobattle, limited autobattle accessible to all players;
[*] The Bard is now available;
[*] Other changes and improvements.
[/list]
